# Direct multi-line transcript questions

Status: DONE
Milestone: Direct question composition
Dependencies: 28_QUESTION_DRAFTS.todo, 40_EXPANDED_READABLE_WORKSPACE.todo

## Purpose

Click one or more Mic/Computer transcript lines directly to populate the question editor.

